      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried cleaning the back area and checking the seal but it didn't seem to change anything. i've been looking down into that bottom tray for a while now and it's just dark and hard to see what's actually going on. is it possible something is stuck down there that i can't see? like a physical object or something blocking the sensor?",
      "source": "evaluator"
